<h2>Hi<%= @user.name.present? ? " #{@user.name}" : "" %>!</h2>

<p>
  Just a heads-up — <strong><%= @contact.name %></strong>'s
  <strong><%= @occasion.kind %></strong> is
  <strong><%= @days_away <= 0 ? "today" : (@days_away == 1 ? "tomorrow" : "in #{@days_away} days") %></strong>
  (<%= @occurrence.strftime("%A, %B %-d") %>).
</p>

<p>Beat the last-minute scramble and send something thoughtful.</p>

<div style="background-color: #f6f2fb; border: 2px solid #b9a3d6; border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px; margin: 20px 0;">
  <p style="margin: 0; font-weight: bold; color: #573b6f;">✨ Suggested design: <%= @suggestion.headline %></p>
  <p style="margin: 8px 0 0 0; color: #573b6f;"><%= @suggestion.blurb %></p>
</div>

<p>
  <a href="<%= @create_url %>" class="primary-button">Create <%= @contact.name %>'s card</a>
</p>

<p style="font-size: 12px; color: #6b7280; margin-top: 24px;">
  You're getting this because <%= @contact.name %> is in your CardJoy occasion book.
</p>
